maluos-gateway (0.3.2) resolute; urgency=medium

  * whoami carries the caller's own spend for the day and the month, so a
    session can show its budget without operator rights
    (maluos-desktop-session, Phase 12).
  * A request that finds no database (before first boot has provisioned
    it, or while PostgreSQL restarts) is answered 503 not_ready and logged
    as "not ready", not as an internal error.

